== Trivia ==
*Based on his dialogue both as a [[Garden Visitor]] and when giving the player {{ID|Shadows indicate riddles, illuminating unseen stars}}, he is quite sentimental of his childhood.

== Bugs ==
*It is common for '''Sirius''' to call players who have his [[Abiphones#Contacts|{{Aqua|Abiphone Contact}}]] and remind them about the Dark Auction significantly later than intended. It is possible for the player to receive the call reminding them of the dark auction after '''Sirius''' has despawned.

